{"pin":"AB00195","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00195","anchor":"","first_line":"O God, my God! Thou hearest my sighs and bitter wailing, my cry and the voice of my lamentation...The Revelation of the Bab may be likened to the sun, its station corresponding to the first sign of the Zodiac - the sign Aries… Pure souls, such as Mirza Abu'l-Fadl, upon him be the Glory of God, spend their nights and days in demonstrating the truth of the Revelation","first_line_orig":"الهی الهی تسمع ضجیجی و صریخی و انینی و حنینی فی جنح اللیالی و تری ذلی  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"820","translations":[{"language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"writing_refs":[{"type":"light","type_name":"Light of the World","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"type":"light","type_name":"Light of the World","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DAK#0950","source":"BRL_DAK","locator":"0950","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/202471507"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK4#080 p.087","source":"MMK4","locator":"080 p.087","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/SWA4/swa4-90.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"NURA#40","source":"NURA","locator":"40","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/nur-i-afaq.pdf"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_SCHOLAR#30x","source":"BRL_SCHOLAR","locator":"30x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/080743651"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#2219x","source":"COC","locator":"2219x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/compilation_writers_writing#2219"},{"kind":"translation","code":"GPB.099-100x","source":"GPB","locator":"099-100x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/756163672"},{"kind":"translation","code":"LOTW#40","source":"LOTW","locator":"40","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/005165897"},{"kind":"translation","code":"WOB.127x","source":"WOB","locator":"127x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/180065536"},{"kind":"translation","code":"WOB.167-168x","source":"WOB","locator":"167-168x","url":"http://www